{"4036130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mecha Force", "steam_appid": 4036130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Force, developed by Ming Studio, redefines mech games by blending immersive 3D cockpit gameplay with modern Roguelite elements. This first-person mech action game channels the passion for classic Japanese mecha anime into an unprecedented combat experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Your Mech to Resist Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit, synchronize with the &quot;Kylin&quot;, and drive the giant mech into battle against mechanized enemies of varying forms. Experience pure mecha aesthetics through immersive combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Upgrade Your Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each sortie, you'll discover new weapon types, abundant upgrade options, diverse combat environments, and mysterious unknown powers that recreate those deja vu moments of brilliance in gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guided by the Enigmatic &quot;Maki&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Machineera&quot; connects with the &quot;Kylin&quot; through Neural Link as your navigator. This mysterious girl will fight alongside you, helping reclaim humanity's future with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront Terror in a Chaotic Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Now, pilot humanity's last hope - the mech &quot;Kylin&quot; - rallying all surviving forces to protect Earth's lifeforms and launch a counteroffensive against the alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Force, developed by Ming Studio, redefines mech games by blending immersive 3D cockpit gameplay with modern Roguelite elements. This first-person mech action game channels the passion for classic Japanese mecha anime into an unprecedented combat experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Your Mech to Resist Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit, synchronize with the &quot;Kylin&quot;, and drive the giant mech into battle against mechanized enemies of varying forms. Experience pure mecha aesthetics through immersive combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Upgrade Your Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each sortie, you'll discover new weapon types, abundant upgrade options, diverse combat environments, and mysterious unknown powers that recreate those deja vu moments of brilliance in gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guided by the Enigmatic &quot;Maki&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Machineera&quot; connects with the &quot;Kylin&quot; through Neural Link as your navigator. This mysterious girl will fight alongside you, helping reclaim humanity's future with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront Terror in a Chaotic Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Now, pilot humanity's last hope - the mech &quot;Kylin&quot; - rallying all surviving forces to protect Earth's lifeforms and launch a counteroffensive against the alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Mecha Force is a first-person 3D action game that blends mecha elements with Roguelite features. You will act as the &quot;Correlator&quot;, customizing and piloting your dedicated giant mech &quot;Kylin&quot; to stand against the alien invaders known as &quot;Dominators&quot;, protect Earth, and reclaim humanity's future.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/2374bc89d0bf3c6466914f0745d9fcee606f4e53/header.jpg?t=1776138468", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776138468", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776138468", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA RTX 3060/AMD Radeon RX 6700XT series or higher</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>